rd_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df01a174cec84896\" href=\"?note=df01a174cec84896\" title=\"73-df-generalized-state-elimination\">73-df-generalized-state-elimination</a> 的输入与输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q&#39;,R&#39;,s,t)\">\\((Q&#39;,R&#39;,s,t)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLang}(Q,R,s,t)=\\operatorname{GLang}(Q&#39;,R&#39;,s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GLang}(Q,R,s,t)=\\operatorname{GLang}(Q&#39;,R&#39;,s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把旧路径中每个经过 k 的最大子段压缩成一条新边；该子段依次为进入 k、在 k 上任意有限次循环、离开 k。反向把选择了新标签第二分支的边展开即可。零次循环和空边标签均由星号及路径定义覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-generalized-state-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"df01a174cec84896","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-generalized-state-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-generalized-state-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"df01a174cec84896","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[73-df-generalized-state-elimination]] 的输入与输出 $(Q',R',s,t)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(Q',R',s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLang}(Q,R,s,t)=\\operatorname{GLang}(Q',R',s,t).","display":true}],"bytes":1202,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-state-elimination-correctness|状态消元保持路径语言]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["df01a174cec84896"]}